OPEN SRE DEMO STARTUP

1. Start Kubernetes

sudo podman start opensre-demo-control-plane opensre-demo-worker

kubectl get nodes
kubectl get pods -A


2. Grafana

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/grafana 3000:80

Open: http://localhost:3000

NOTE: the "OpenSRE Cluster & Pod Overview" dashboard is provisioned via
observability/grafana-values.yaml. After changing that file, reload it:

helm upgrade grafana grafana/grafana \
  -n observability \
  -f observability/grafana-values.yaml


3. VictoriaMetrics

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/victoriametrics-victoria-metrics-single-server 8428:8428

Check:
curl http://localhost:8428/-/healthy


4. OpenTelemetry

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/otel-collector-opentelemetry-collector 4317:4317 4318:4318


5. Backend

cd ~/Projects/opensre-demo/opensre-backend
source .venv/bin/activate
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001


6. Frontend

cd ~/Projects/opensre-demo/frontend
npm run dev

Open: http://localhost:5173


7. Aerospike & Yugabyte

docker start aerospike
docker start yugabyte


DEMO FLOW

Frontend → Metrics page → pick Instance / Node / Pod
→ embedded Grafana dashboard re-filters live

Frontend → Kubernetes page → Investigate pod → OpenSRE + Gemini → RCA
Grafana → Show metrics/observability
VictoriaMetrics → Metrics backend
OpenTelemetry → Telemetry collector